Let savings of Krishna is x.

Krishna gave {1over 9} to his son = {x × 1over 9} = {x over 9} 

Remaining amount = x - {x over 9} = {8x over 9}

Krishna gave {3 over 4} of his remaining amount to his Elder Daughter

= {8x over 9}× {3 over 4} = {2x over 3}

Remaining gave to second daughter = {8x over 9}- {2x over 3} = {8x - 6x over 9} = {2x over 9}

